{"language":"en","values":[["/names/cn","诡草"],["/names/en","Rhys"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名性格火爆的射手，能够在攻击的同时持续移动。"],["/description_i18n/en","A fiery-tempered Marksman who can continue moving while attacking."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","呀——呼，等不及了！"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Oh yeah! I can't wait!"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","更大口径，更大弹匣，更强火力！"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Bigger bullets! More in the mag! Phenomenal firepower!"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","哇哈哈哈哈！炸吧！砰！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Ahahahahah! Yes, make it go boom!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","切，走着……瞧……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","Just you wait... And see..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","哈！说什么来着！"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Ha! What did I say!"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","（鸟头紧张特写）怎么了？（弹开枪）砰！啪！（正面+全身特写）我的枪火声！"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_i18n/en","Hear that?! Bang Pow! That's the sound of my gun!"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","啊，想看看我们的本事，那，痴意重逢者，就给他们点好看的！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Huh, wanna see what we can do? Well then, we'll give them a little.... spectacle!"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","呜，哎哥们儿，来个漂移，哈哈哈哈，差不多，差不多。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Eahh... ay, bro, bring on something fun. Hahahahaha! Good boy, well done!"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","诶，枪口总会对准目标！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","The barrel's always right on target!"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","你从哪弄到的？哈！真是太棒了！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/en","Where did you get that?! Ha! Fantastic!"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","送我的？谢了。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/en","For me? Thanks!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","哈，要不要来点热闹？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Hey, wanna have some fun?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","等会儿去兜风吧！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/en","Let's go for a ride later."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","哈哈哈哈，再加点辣椒！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Hahaha, more chili!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","呀哈，冰雪冲刺！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Yeah, let's dash in the snow!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","节日大餐？快端上来！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Holiday banquet? Bring it on!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","燃烧吧！爆炸吧！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Burn, explode!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","砰、砰、啪！啊哈哈！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Boom, bang, crackle! Ahaha!"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","据流沙之爪的其他人说，诡草说话时会有一种诡异的节奏感。"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/en","According to other people in the Quicksand Claws, Rhys always speaks in a strangely erratic way."],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","诡草为自己的陆行鸟起名为：炽翼冲锋者。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/en","Rhys chose \"Plumecharger\" as the name of his bird mount."],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","诡草用枪的准头不太好，比起一击必杀，更偏好以量取胜。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/en","Because of his poor aim, Rhys prefers barraging his enemies with countless bullets instead of killing them in one shot."],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","“还以为他是个坏小子，没想到对那些鸟还挺好的。”被困在流沙之爪的商人如此评价那时见到的诡草。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/en","\"I thought he was a bad kid, but he actually takes really good care of those birds.\"—Merchant's description of Rhys after being taken prisoner by the Quicksand Claws."],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","诡草想提高射击的准头，但觉得刻苦练习这件事非常不帅气，便一直没有实施。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/en","Rhys wants to improve his aim but thinks endless training is too uncool for him. As a result, his aim continues to be subpar."],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","诡草试图为每一只陆行鸟都起一个帅气的名字，却因为词汇量不足、起的名字重复太多而作罢。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/en","Rhys once attempted to give every single terrabird a cool name, but due to his limited vocabulary, multiple birds ended up with the same name."],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","据村里的老人说，诡草从小就十分倔强，就算被揍了也会瞪着眼睛不承认自己的错误。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/en","According to the village elders, Rhys has always been a headstrong boy. Even after a sound beating, he continues glaring at his attacker and refuses to admit any wrongdoing."],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","据说，诡草常向别人炫耀他在流沙之爪的恶徒生涯——然而实际上，他只是在那里喂鸟而已。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/en","They say Rhys often brags about his criminal stint with the notorious Quicksand Claws. In reality, he was just there to feed the birds."],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","流沙之爪的大部分人不会在意那些在深红高原的异变中不幸遇难者的骨骸，但诡草是个例外。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/en","Most members of the Quicksand Claws care little for the remains of those who lost their lives in the Crimson Highlands. Rhys, however, is an exception."],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","诡草拿到的第一把枪是从赏金猎人尸体上捡来的，第一次接触到枪的诡草还太小，甚至举不动枪托。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/en","Rhys obtained his first gun from the corpse of a bounty hunter. At the time, he was still too little to even raise the rifle's butt."],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","嘿，你们在炖什么！好香啊！"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/en","Hey! What's for dinner? It smells so good!"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412090.json"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11412090.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","诡草 & 索恩"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/en","Rhys & Soren"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","风蚀飞地"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Eroded Enclave"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/1/name_i18n/cn","深红高原"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/1/name_i18n/en","Crimson Highlands"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","喂，你们烤肉的速度太慢了！"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/en","Hey! You're taking too long with the meat!"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412180.json"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11412180.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","诡草 & 瓦尔克"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/en","Rhys & Walker"],["/interaction_records/1/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","风蚀飞地"],["/interaction_records/1/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Eroded Enclave"],["/interaction_records/1/locations/1/name_i18n/cn","深红高原"],["/interaction_records/1/locations/1/name_i18n/en","Crimson Highlands"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","哈，要不要来点热闹？"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/en","Hey, wanna have some fun?"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415080.json"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415080.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","诡草"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/en","Rhys"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","哈哈哈哈，再加点辣椒！"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/en","Hahaha, more chili!"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415081.json"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415081.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","诡草"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/en","Rhys"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","呀哈，冰雪冲刺！"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/en","Yeah, let's dash in the snow!"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415389.json"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415389.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","诡草"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/en","Rhys"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","节日大餐？快端上来！"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/en","Holiday banquet? Bring it on!"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415390.json"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415390.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","诡草"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/en","Rhys"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","燃烧吧！爆炸吧！"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/en","Burn, explode!"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415561.json"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415561.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","诡草"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/en","Rhys"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","砰、砰、啪！啊哈哈！"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/en","Boom, bang, crackle! Ahaha!"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415562.json"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415562.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","诡草"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/en","Rhys"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","哇哦，真难得，在这里能碰上懂时尚的人！"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/en","Hey, you! Finally, someone with an actual sense of fashion around here!"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415665.json"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415665.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","库露露 & 诡草"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/en","Kulu & Rhys"]]}